## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## DEFERRED / UNCERTAIN VALUE
## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## Items with unclear ROI or requiring more research.

# - [ ] Anti-spoofing (LBP texture): Adds 2-3ms latency, effectiveness varies
#       → Consider only if photo/screen attacks are a real threat
#       → Alternative: require blink detection or head movement

# - [ ] Temporal voting (80% agreement): May conflict with identity stability bonus
#       → Current approach (consistency_count + margin) may be sufficient
#       → Test before implementing additional voting layer

# - [ ] Runtime PLDA recalibration: Risk of model drift from false positives
#       → Only consider with high-confidence threshold (>0.95) and manual review

# - [ ] Extreme angle fallback (gait): Requires additional model, complex integration
#       → Defer until face-based recognition proves insufficient

# - [ ] IR/night mode: Requires IR camera hardware for proper testing
#       → Implement when hardware available
